<BaseLayout title={'About: the engineers who build the networks’ tooling and do the integrations | The Aha Company'} description={'The Aha Company: seventeen engineers across the United States, France and Brazil, founded 2020. How we work, who we are, and the ecosystems we hold roles in.'}>
<main><section><div class="ab_introcontainer"><a class="art_back" data-back="1" href="/">← Back to home</a><div class="ab_introhead"><p class="cs_eyebrow">About</p><h1 class="intro_h1">We build the tooling. We do the integrations.</h1><p class="art_lede">Founded in 2020. Seventeen engineers across the United States, France and Brazil. Core contributors on Stellar, program partners on XRPL, integrations in progress on Canton.</p></div><figure class="ab_photo"><img alt="The Aha Company team around a table in the office" class="ab_photoimg" loading="lazy" src="/images/photos/team-photo-office.webp"/><figcaption class="ab_photocaption">The team · United States · France · Brazil</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="ab_facts"><div class="ab_factscontainer"><ul class="ab_factsgrid" role="list"><li class="ab_fact"><span class="ab_factnum">2020</span><span class="ab_factlabel">Founded</span></li><li class="ab_fact"><span class="ab_factnum">17</span><span class="ab_factlabel">Engineers</span></li><li class="ab_fact"><span class="ab_factnum">3</span><span class="ab_factlabel">Countries: United States, France, Brazil</span></li></ul></div></section><section class="ab_white"><div class="ab_container"><div class="ab_howgrid"><div class="ab_howhead"><h2 class="ab_h2">How we work</h2><p class="art_lede">One voice for two very different rooms: a bank’s risk committee and a protocol team’s GitHub.</p></div><ul class="ab_howlist" role="list"><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">An engineer on every call</h3><p class="ab_howbody">The first conversation is thirty minutes with someone who has shipped the kind of system you are asking about. No sales team.</p></li><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">Milestones your team can verify</h3><p class="ab_howbody">NDA, then an MOU with the scope cut into milestones. Each one has an output you can check, on testnet, before mainnet.</p></li><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">We say no early</h3><p class="ab_howbody">Where an ecosystem program applies, we scope and draft the application. Where it doesn’t, or where the architecture is wrong for the network, we say so before any work starts.</p></li><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">We stay on the account</h3><p class="ab_howbody">Production surfaces questions a testnet never asks. Deployment comes with runbooks and handover, and we keep evolving the system with your team after launch.</p></li><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">Public goods, maintained</h3><p class="ab_howbody">The tooling we build for ecosystems is open source with a quarterly proposal and review, not a one-off deliverable.</p></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="ab_team" data-ab="team"><div class="ab_container"><div class="tm_teamhead"><h2 class="ab_h2">The team</h2><p class="tm_count">Ten of seventeen · United States · France · Brazil · Austria</p></div><TeamGrid variant="about" /></div></section><section class="ab_white"><div class="ab_container"><h2 class="ab_h2">Roles we hold in the ecosystems</h2><ul class="ab_rolesgrid" role="list"><li class="ab_rolecard"><img alt="Stellar" class="ab_rolelogo" loading="lazy" src="/images/logos/logo-light-stellar.webp"/><p class="ab_rolebody">Core contributor · Stellar Community Fund reviewer · Stellar Architect Program expert · maintainer of Scaffold Stellar, the Stellar CLI plugin system, Stellar Registry and Nido</p></li><li class="ab_rolecard"><img alt="XRPL" class="ab_rolelogo" loading="lazy" src="/images/logos/logo-xrpl-transparent.webp"/><p class="ab_rolebody">Ripple program partner: accelerator cohorts and hackathons, continuous work on developer experience</p></li><li class="ab_rolecard"><img alt="Canton" class="ab_rolelogo" loading="lazy" src="/images/logos/logo-light-canton.webp"/><p class="ab_rolebody">Integrations in progress</p></li></ul></div></section><section class="footer_section"><div class="ab_officescontainer"><div class="ab_officesgrid"><div class="ab_office"><h3 class="ab_officecountry">United States</h3><p class="ab_officeentity">The Aha Company Inc.</p><p class="ab_officeaddr">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse varius enim in eros elementum tristique. Duis cursus, mi quis viverra ornare, eros dolor interdum nulla, ut commodo diam libero vitae erat. Aenean faucibus nibh et justo cursus id rutrum lorem imperdiet. Nunc ut sem vitae risus tristique posuere.<span>108 W. 13th Street, Suite 100</span><br/><span>Wilmington, DE 19801</span></p></div><div class="ab_office"><h3 class="ab_officecountry">France</h3><p class="ab_officeentity">The Aha Company SAS</p><p class="ab_officeaddr">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse varius enim in eros elementum tristique. Duis cursus, mi quis viverra ornare, eros dolor interdum nulla, ut commodo diam libero vitae erat. Aenean faucibus nibh et justo cursus id rutrum lorem imperdiet. Nunc ut sem vitae risus tristique posuere.<span>9 rue des Colonnes</span><br/><span>75002 Paris</span></p></div><div class="ab_office"><h3 class="ab_officecountry">Brazil</h3><p class="ab_officeentity">The Aha Company Ltda.</p><p class="ab_officeaddr">Entity details to confirm</p></div></div></div></section></main>
